rooms_desc ({"You have entered the living room of talmores house. Here you see a largecomfy couch in front of a large T.V.  To the left of the couch is a big fireplace. There is a thick fluffy bearskin rug on the floor in front ofthe fire place. Over the fireplace hangs a velvet picture of a naked woman.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
